    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a terrifying post-apocalyptic world where radiation has transformed human beings into fearsome mutants.  Radiation Cleaner is an intense multiplayer cooperative game where up to 4 players infiltrate an abandoned hospital overrun by mutants. Your mission: destroy 10 mutant camps, repair the generators and survive. But beware, if a mutant catches you, you'll join their ranks and hunt down your former teammates. Work together to complete the mission, because escape isn't an option until the objective is met.</strong></p>",
